{"title":"나쁜 X","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=LlYNH/hzXapAS9Ip/91p6m0lSPfitXJLFRCbyd0&filename=th3","synopsis":"‘진실한 사랑이란 게 정말 있을까?’\n\n일이건 연애건 자신의 앞길은 자신이 개척할 수 있다며\n늘 자신감 가득한 \"하이\".\n\n호기심 많고 무엇이든 도전해 보는 성격 탓에\n건드리지 말아야 할 금단의 사과,\n\"영현\"과 만나 쓴맛을 맛보게 되고,\n일련의 사건들까지 엎친 데 덮친 격으로 일어나 \"하이\"는\n서른셋 인생 처음으로 본인 마음대로 되지 않는 상황과\n심리 상태에 직면한다.\n\n확신했던 것들에 대해 자신을 잃으며\n괴로워하는 그녀의 곁엔 대학생 때부터\n묵묵히 곁을 지켜온 \"혁우\"와\n우연한 기회로 만나게 된 \"재희\"가 있는데...\n\n공허한 \"하이\"의 마음에 과연 진실한 사랑이 채워질 수 있을까?","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":72,"change":{"type":"down","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":103,"change":{"type":"down","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":170,"change":{"type":"down","amount":67}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":204,"change":{"type":"down","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":221,"change":{"type":"down","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":235,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":242,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":237,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":254,"change":{"type":"down","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":297,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":281,"change":{"type":"up","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":281,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":229,"change":{"type":"up","amount":52}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":265,"change":{"type":"down","amount":36}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":272,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":281,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":291,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":291,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":272,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":286,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-09-13","rank":283,"ch